IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WEBRTC-SW-IDB-FLEX.

DATA DIVISION.
01 WEBRTC-CONN         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SW-CACHE-CNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 IDB-RECORD-CNT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SUBSYSTEM-SCORE     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-WEBRTC-SW-IDB-FLEX.
    IF WEBRTC-CONN == 0
        GO TO SUBSYSTEM-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF SW-CACHE-CNT == 0
        GO TO SUBSYSTEM-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    IF IDB-RECORD-CNT == 0
        GO TO SUBSYSTEM-ERROR.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 9998 TO SUBSYSTEM-SCORE.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 WEBRTC-CONN.
    WEIGHT 30 SW-CACHE-CNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

SUBSYSTEM-ERROR.
    MOVE 0 TO SUBSYSTEM-SCORE.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
